/- A run fixes the powers and varies the column. Its endpoint inequalities select the
   first two branches of fastC for every column. In that range, shifting the signed
   denominator index by one lets natural subtraction handle all negative arguments.
   The original evaluator also handles any run outside the verified range. -/
open K1_13_2_3
open private fastDen fastC fastOld fastKernel from ProximityPrize.SubmissionLower.Numeric6Defs
